(iii) the Training Manual, which refers to Section 37 of the Act of 2006 and Rule 2.1.3 of the Rules of 2011 and provides for an induction training to the FSOs who are newly recruited ; and (iv) clarification issued by the FSSAI dated 03.10.2018 ; we are of the considered opinion that as per the literal reading of the provisions, the requisite qualification for FSO has to be evaluated on the date on which the notification for appointment as FSO is issued and if the training is successfully completed at any time prior to it, the same would be very much in compliance of the provisions of Section 37 of the Act of 2006 and Rule 2.1.3 of Rules of 2011.
